  "body": "### Summary\nAs a reader in light mode, I want every secondary text of the reader (dates, blocked-quote headers) at 4.5:1 or more, so that it stays readable. #644 (PR #1355) fixed the cases it named; its adversarial review found two more of the same class.\n\n### Facts (from the Opus review of #1355, measured in its contrast tests)\n1. A folded blocked quote inside a moderation message (`--modo` background): `--secondary` at **4.23:1**.\n2. The date of a continuation message (75 % opacity) on an allowlisted message, classic look, light: **3.28:1**.\n\n### Scope\n- Same fix class as #644: raise those two to 4.5:1 without changing the other themes; extend `ReaderAllowlistContrastWebTests` (or its sibling) with both cases, each failing before the fix.\n\n### Acceptance\n- Both cases measured at ≥ 4.5:1 in the hosted contrast tests; no other contrast test regresses.\n\nFound by: Opus review of #1355 (cloud/i644-sonnet).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
